  'doc.title': 'How an Economy Is Measured · An Interactive Essay',
  'doc.desc': 'How do we measure how well an economy is doing? From the three-sided GDP identity, price indexes and CPI, growth-rate traps, PPP and Gini, labour markets, business cycles and the Sahm rule, and Solow growth accounting to GDP boundaries and the 2025 SNA frontier.',
