  'ch10.p3': 'The table below compiles key latest "Figures of Merit" across major economies as of <strong>November 13, 2026</strong>—note the <strong>definition</strong> and <strong>release date</strong> in each column, because metrics sharing the same label often rest on fundamentally different methodology (real-time nowcasts indicate that as of mid-November 2026, the Atlanta Fed GDPNow tracked U.S. Q4 2026 growth at <strong>3.4%–3.5%</strong> SAAR, while the New York Fed Staff Nowcast stood at <strong>2.9%</strong>):',
  'ch10.tbl.h1': 'Economy',
